    {
      "name": "places/ChIJUXyCManzaS4RtinpvkHotlQ/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xsV2VUQXlPWFl0TVZBd2RpMVJNVUU0WWxCalVGRRAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "9 months ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "A wonderful café with a spacious and beautiful atmosphere. The place offers plenty of seating and feels very comfortable, whether you’re there to work or to meet friends. The staff are extremely friendly, and both the food and coffee are excellent. I highly recommend this café definitely worth visiting!",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
