      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "4 years ago",
      "rating": 4,
      "text": {
        "text": "This place is perfect to hang out with friends or to work from cafe, because it's super spacious and has so many seats outdoors. Unfortunately the no smoking area is not that big upstairs.\n\nWhat can be improved is the taste of coffee itself. For me it's just so-so. Also, internet might not be reliable, so make sure to have a backup internet (tethering from phone).",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
